- Apple Low-Latency HLS: https://developer.apple.com/streaming/
- CMAF (ISO/IEC 23000-19) and fMP4: https://www.w3.org/TR/mse-byte-stream-format-isobmff/
- DASH-IF Low Latency: https://dashif.org/docs/
